+---
+id: task-003-rfc-6902-patch-conformance
+type: task
+title: "RFC 6902 patch conformance"
+status: approved
+format: 1
+---
+
+Correct `applyPatch` so that its validation, operation ordering, pointer handling, and error behaviour
+conform to RFC 6902. Preserve the public API guarantee that neither input is mutated.
+
+Acceptance criteria:
+
+- All six RFC 6902 operations implement their specified target and source semantics, including root,
+  array, move, copy, and test edge cases.
+- Invalid patch documents, operations, pointers, required members, and impossible targets fail before
+  any invalid operation is applied; evaluation stops at the first failure.
+- Valid JSON input is handled safely and non-JSON runtime values are rejected.
+- Tests cover the corrected behaviour, including failure cases, and the complete test suite passes.
